./data/living_catalog_updates/update_2026-08-09/14_snapshot/crop_ledger.json:2989:        "rationale": "The rendered crop visibly shows the image-input side of H2O: an H&E image FM data block with dataset sources TCGA, GTEx, and In-house, plus the H2O ST FM and biomodal alignment data block with HEST1K. That is enough evidence to understand what enters the model for the H&E pretraining and paired alignment routes.",
