./data/living_catalog_updates/update_2026-08-09/14_snapshot/crop_ledger.json:3054:        "rationale": "The final crop shows a high-level data summary, not a visible input interface into H2O. It does not show raw H&E patches entering the model, paired H&E/ST alignment at the model boundary, or any evaluation-time H&E input route. The full source figure shown on the left does not contain a clearer region within this panel that visibly depicts an actual listed H2O input route.",
./data/living_catalog_updates/update_2026-08-09/14_snapshot/crop_ledger.json:3122:        "rationale": "The crop shows the actual model inputs and alignment interface for H2O: H&E imaging and spatial sequencing feeding the contrastive-learning and ST-prediction pipeline. That satisfies the requirement to show a source object or immediate model-facing interface.",
